  "description": "Among the Fremen, Muad'Dib is more than vermin. The desert mouse is a sign that life on Arrakis survives by thrift, quiet movement, and exact use of what little the world provides.\n\nIn play, the creature is sparse frontier fauna. It is not a ranching animal or a bulk food source, but a little meat, a little leather, and a single water drop can matter in the first hard days of a desert campaign.",
