    "overview": {
      "body": "Muad'Dib belongs to Arrakis in a way the colony never quite can. It survives by staying light on the sand, keeping to the margins, and living on what harsher creatures ignore."
    },
    "survivalRole": {
      "body": "For a player, the desert mouse is emergency utility rather than routine prey. It reinforces the mod's survival scale: every scrap of meat, every ration of water, and every choice to cross open sand has weight."
    },
